 noise.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis PR pins all GitHub Actions to immutable commit SHAs instead of mutable version tags.\n\n- Pin 6 unpinned actions to full 40-character SHAs\n- Add version comments for readability\n\n## How to verify\n\nReview the diff, each change is mechanical and preserves workflow behavior:\n- **SHA pinning**: `action@v3` becomes `action@abc123 # v3`, original version preserved as comment\n- No workflow logic, triggers, or permissions are modified\n\nI've been researching CI/CD supply chain attack vectors and submitting fixes to affected repos. Based on that research I built a scanner called Runner Guard and open sourced it [here](https://github.com/Vigilant-LLC/runner-guard) so you can scan yourself if you want to. I'll be posting more advisories over the next few weeks [on Twitter](https://x.com/vigilance_one) if you want to stay in the loop.\n\nIf you have any questions, reach out. I'll be monitoring comms.\n\n\\- Chris (dagecko)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4